  "description": "Test build of Wukong as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Wukong so Stone Skin regenerates a share of his max health (0.35% every 5 seconds, plus as much again per stack: 2.1% at five stacks) instead of the main pack's flat amount, and makes Warrior Trickster's clone a unit of its own (0.2.0) through the mod API's spawn_unit - drawn from his own sheet where he cast W, it stands for 4 seconds with his health then, attacks an enemy near it once a second (50% of his attack), can be attacked and killed, and spins with him when he casts Cyclone (its pulses and the knock-up natively); a host that gives no unit keeps the main pack's clone, drawn where it stands by the add-on (the main pack's clone pictures never show in game). Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
